  "steps": [
    "Pasta. Cook the rigatoni per the packet; reserve a mug of pasta water.",
    "Hot honey. Mix honey, hot sauce and chilli flakes.",
    "Chicken. Season with paprika, garlic and onion granules, salt and pepper. Fry, leaving it undisturbed 2–3 minutes for colour, until cooked through. Pour over most of the hot honey (keep about ½ tsp), toss until sticky, then remove and keep warm.",
    "Sauce. In the same pan, soften the onion and garlic. Add tomato purée and cook 1–2 minutes. Stir in the reserved hot honey, then the cream. Swirl the pasta water in the cream jug and add it.",
    "Finish. Stir in Parmesan, chilli flakes, salt and pepper; simmer a couple of minutes to thicken. Toss in the pasta, top with the chicken and garnish with parsley."
  ],
